   "id": "starter-cooking-with-kids-ants-on-a-log",
   "title": "Ants on a Log",
   "description": "",
   "ingredients": [
    "4 celery sticks",
    "¼ cup peanut butter (or sunflower butter)",
    "2 tbsp raisins"
   ],
   "steps": [
    "Wash the celery and cut each stick in half. (A grown-up can help with the knife.)",
    "Spread peanut butter into the groove of each piece with a butter knife.",
    "Line up raisins on top: those are the ants."
   ],
   "notes": "",
