   "id": "starter-cooking-with-kids-mini-pizzas",
   "title": "Mini Pizzas",
   "description": "",
   "ingredients": [
    "4 English muffins, split",
    "½ cup pizza sauce",
    "1 cup shredded mozzarella",
    "toppings: pepperoni, peppers, olives"
   ],
   "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 425°F. Put the muffin halves on a baking sheet.",
    "Spoon sauce on each half and spread it out.",
    "Sprinkle on the cheese and add your toppings.",
    "A grown-up puts them in the oven. Bake for 10 minutes, until the cheese bubbles."
